# DATE    : $Date$
# FILE    : pamadm
#
#
#   Master script for administrator of DIRAC
#   Written by Trond Saue Oct 1 1997
#   Polish by Thomas Enevoldsen Oct 2 1997
#   Additional polish and new features by J .Thyssen 1998
#   Changed to ksh. jth Aug 24 1998 
